  "objectives": [
    "Identify structural components of DNA (sugar-phosphate backbone, nitrogenous bases, hydrogen bonds) and how they assemble into a double helix.",
    "Apply complementary base-pairing rules and understand antiparallel orientation.",
    "Trace the process of semiconservative replication and the functions of key enzymes (helicase, DNA polymerase, ligase).",
    "Explain leading vs. lagging strand synthesis due to antiparallel orientation and unidirectional polymerase activity."
